      "message": "fix(post): Haas, Mazak and Sinumerik guard probe positioning moves\n\n#174 made the engine refuse every probe op on a post without\nonProbeGuard. Haas and Mazak now write each GUARD record as a G31 skip\nwith a #5061+ position test per moving axis, alarming #3000=3 (Mazak in\nits IF[..]GOTOn form); Sinumerik writes a MEAS=1 G1 block and alarms\nSETAL(65002) when $AC_MEA[1] shows the probe responded. Each is\ndistinct from the no-contact alarm. Haas/Mazak fold the target's sign\ninto the operator (minusU). The three probe_bore_centre goldens gain\nonly the guard lines (plus Mazak label / Sinumerik block renumbering).\n\nRefs #173\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL",
